Z||000009||LZeitgeist||08-10-2001||03:35 PM||||Hee hee hee... <P>It was nice meeting you (I'm assuming that was *you* up there with the car...)<P>I wish I could have seen the look on your face when Phil announced that there were "no Indys present"... :::chuckle:::<P>Damn, just when ya think you're a shoe-in for a trophy, just 'cuz you're the only one in your class, THINK AGAIN... LOL!<P>Congrats on the win... thanks for bringing that beauty up there so we could see it.<P>Hope to see you somewhere around the Carolinas...<P>------------------<BR>Patrick W. Heinske  --  LZeitgeist@aol.com<BR>1988 Red Fiero Formula<BR>- 1st Place - Stock Coupe - FOCOSEVA 2000<BR>- 3rd Place - Stock Formula - FOCOA Nat'l 2001||||reg||1
